  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU - Water Operators&apos; Partnerships</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action will enhance partnerships (twinning) development between European and partner countries&#xbf; public and private water utilities and operators, with consequent positive impacts on people livelihood especially in terms of accessibility (vicinity), availability (quantity and continuity) and affordability (price) of water supply and sanitation services.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
